# qmldir — explicit module manifest for quickshell/modules/session/ (Phase
# 20 Plan 06, QPOWER-01). Mirrors every sibling module manifest's own
# standing instruction (modules/qmldir's header states this as a
# repo-wide rule): any .qml type added to this directory that is NOT
# declared below becomes unresolvable to shell.qml's `import
# "modules/session"`. A type MUST be registered in the SAME commit that
# creates it.
#
# PowerMenu is NOT a singleton — shell.qml mounts it behind a LazyLoader
# (the summon-via-LazyLoader idiom every other dismissible surface in this
# shell uses, `active: false` at rest), never an always-on instance: the
# dialog exists only while summoned.
module qs.modules.session
PowerMenu 1.0 PowerMenu.qml
PowerMenuBackend 1.0 PowerMenuBackend.qml
# PowerActions (quick-260821-6z1 Task 12) — the six power-menu actions,
# extracted to a singleton so a settings page (which has no live
# PowerMenu instance to read) and PowerMenu.qml itself share one source
# of truth. Singleton keyword required here per this file's own header
# rule.
singleton PowerActions 1.0 PowerActions.qml
